# TypeScript rules for this project

- Strict mode enabled. No `any` without a comment explaining why.
- No default exports (use named exports).
- Imports: absolute paths from `@/` for internals; relative only for siblings.
- Async/await instead of `.then` chains.
- Errors: use Result types or typed exceptions; no silent failures.
- Schemas: Zod for runtime validation at all I/O boundaries.
- `cn()` (clsx + tailwind-merge) for Tailwind class composition.
- Components export typed Props and accept `className?: string`.
